# Git remotes — personal only

- **Allowed remote for push/update/delete:** `personal` → `https://github.com/Soumen2581/bosque-records.git`
- **Forbidden:** any write to TribeWarez remotes (`origin` when it points at TribeWarez, `TribeWarez/bosque-records`, `TribeWarez/cus_bosque-records`).
- Do **not** `git push origin`, delete TribeWarez branches, change TribeWarez settings, or open/merge PRs against TribeWarez unless the user explicitly overrides this rule in the current message.
- Default: `git push personal HEAD` / `git push -u personal main` for publishes.
- Reads/fetches from TribeWarez are allowed only if needed for comparison; prefer `personal` as the source of truth.
